# Symlinks into the household Claude harness, which lives in the sibling
# nephalemsec/master-project checkout (~/Desktop/Github/master-project).
#
# DELIBERATE DEVIATION from master rule git/22-ignore-files.md ("Master Symlinks
# (Always Tracked)"), which mandates tracking these two and states the deviation
# is not warranted by repo visibility. Overridden for thoth by maintainer
# decision: this repo is public, and a tracked symlink that resolves only on a
# machine with master-project as a sibling gives every other clone a dangling
# link. Revisit if that rule is amended.
.claude/rules/master
docs/master

# Legacy harness symlinks, superseded by the mimir plugin (see the master
# setup-symlinks command). Ignored so they cannot be re-committed if a tool
# recreates them.
.claude/commands/master
.claude/hooks/master
.claude/skills

